<title>CHINA: Bankers Trust sets warrants on banking stocks.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on banking stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Turst International Plc said on Thursday it launched 3.23 billion American style call warrants on a basket of banking stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> HSBC Holdings Plc			   0.0016 shrs</p>
<p> Hang Seng Bank Ltd			  0.0040 shrs</p>
<p> Ka Wah Bank Ltd			     0.0200 shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$1.1362     PREMIUM	  23.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.0270     GEARING	  4.21x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	14.AUG.97     MIN EXER LOT   200,000</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 12.JUN.98     LISTING	  HONG KONG</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT   HK$1.1362     GOVERNING LAW  ENGLISH</p>
<p> NOTE		 PHYSICAL OR CASH SETTLEMENT AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>			DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
